{"id":"b0dd9bf0-0012-4249-bf3f-7d5c0bf831d7","revision":1,"last_node_id":38,"last_link_id":52,"nodes":[{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-5260,800],"size":[530,640],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# ZMongo Save Image Demo\n\n## Purpose\nThis workflow demonstrates the complete save-and-verify loop:\n\n1. Generate an image in ComfyUI.\n2. Save the image into a ZMongo-compatible document.\n3. Return the new `document_id`.\n4. Immediately load the saved image back from the same document.\n5. Preview/save the verified image locally.\n\n## Required settings\n- `00 Local File Store Session` is used by default. It stores JSON/image data locally inside the ComfyUI-ZMongo plugin folder.\n- `Collection Name` is set to `images`.\n- `field_path` is set to `image_data`.\n- Leave `document_id` blank on the save node to create a new document.\n- The save node outputs the new `document_id`, which is already connected to the display node.\n\n## Recommended use\n- Run the workflow once.\n- Open the `JSON Result` preview.\n- Confirm that `success` is true and that a `document_id` was returned.\n- The `Verify by Loading Image Back from ZMongo` node should display the saved image.\n- Use `Save Document Value` or related document nodes later to add metadata, tags, review notes, or workflow status.\n\n## Important\nThe optional `Load Image` node is left in the workflow only as an alternate source. The active save path uses the generated image from `VAEDecode`, not the uploaded image node.\n\nTo save an uploaded image instead, disconnect the image input on `Save Generated Image to ZMongo` and connect the `Load Image` output to it.\n"],"color":"#2a363b","bgcolor":"#3f5159"},{"id":20,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-3300,820],"size":[430,260],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Save Node Instructions","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# Save Node Notes\n\n- `collection_name`: usually `images`.\n- `field_path`: use `image_data`.\n- `filename`: display name stored with the image.\n- `document_id`: leave blank to create a new record.\n- `doc_key`: optional stable key for demos or repeatable saves.\n- `metadata_json`: must be valid JSON.\n\nThe save node returns:\n- `json`\n- `document_id`\n- `field_path`\n- `refresh`\n- `created_new_document`\n"],"color":"#2a363b","bgcolor":"#3f5159"},{"id":10,"type":"ZMongoApiEasySaveImageNode","pos":[-3310,1150],"size":[430,330],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"session","name":"session","type":"ZMONGO_API_SESSION","link":27},{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":23},{"localized_name":"collection_name","name":"collection_name","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"collection_name"},"link":37},{"localized_name":"field_path","name":"field_path","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"field_path"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"filename","name":"filename","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"document_id","name":"document_id","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"document_id"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"doc_key","name":"doc_key","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"doc_key"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"metadata_json","name":"metadata_json","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"metadata_json"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"json","name":"json","type":"STRING","links":[12]},{"localized_name":"document_id","name":"document_id","type":"STRING","links":[48]},{"localized_name":"field_path","name":"field_path","type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"refresh","name":"refresh","type":"STRING","links":[18]},{"localized_name":"created_new_document","name":"created_new_document","type":"BOOLEAN","links":null}],"title":"Save Generated Image to ZMongo","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ZMongoApiEasySaveImageNode"},"widgets_values":["images","image_data","zmongo_demo_generated.png","","","{\n  \"workflow\": \"ZMongo Save Image Demo\",\n  \"storage_mode\": \"local_file_store_or_hosted_zmongo\",\n  \"field_path\": \"image_data\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Demonstrates saving a generated ComfyUI image to ZMongo and loading it back by document_id.\"\n}"]},{"id":33,"type":"ZMongoApiBrowseCollectionImagesNode","pos":[-3840,790],"size":[400,470],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"session","name":"session","type":"ZMONGO_API_SESSION","link":44},{"localized_name":"collection_name","name":"collection_name","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"collection_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"field_path","name":"field_path","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"field_path"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"query_json","name":"query_json","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"query_json"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"limit","name":"limit","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"limit"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"skip","name":"skip","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"skip"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"selected_index","name":"selected_index","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"selected_index"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"thumbnail_width","name":"thumbnail_width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"thumbnail_width"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"thumbnail_height","name":"thumbnail_height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"thumbnail_height"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"master_key_hex","name":"master_key_hex","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"master_key_hex"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cache","name":"cache","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"cache"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"refresh_token","name":"refresh_token","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"refresh_token"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"image_batch","name":"image_batch","type":"IMAGE","links":[47]},{"localized_name":"selected_image","name":"selected_image","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"localized_name":"json","name":"json","type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"document_ids","name"